  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed conversion of this property would provide no compensatory provision for family accommodation in accordance with Policy DMD 5 (2.a). Consequently, the proposed conversion into two flats would result in the loss of a viable family sized property. This would be contrary to the NPPF (2019), Policies GG1, GG4, H1, H9 of The London Plan (2021), policies CP4 and CP5 of the Core Strategy. Policies DMD5 and DMD8 of the Development Management Document (2014) and the London Plan Housing SPG as well as the Enfield Strategic Housing Market Assessment (2015).",
    "The proposed conversion of this property into 2no. flats, due to the  proximity of conversions at neighbouring sites (Nos 36 and 38), would result in the over concentration of converted properties clustered in the locality. This would be detrimental to the established residential character of the immediate visual catchment area. This would be contrary to Policies GG1, GG4, H1, H9 of The London Plan (2021), Policies CP4, CP5 and CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010) and Policy DMD 5 (b) of the Development Management Document (2014)."
